figure><figure><a href="{{ 'uv-print-sample-ballpoint-pens.png' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="View ballpoint pen printing sample"><img src="{{ 'uv-print-sample-ballpoint-pens.png' | asset_img_url: '700x' }}" width="1448" height="1086" loading="lazy" alt="Colorful ballpoint pens with printed logos and promotional designs"></a><figcaption><h3>Ballpoint Pens</h3><p>Add logos and promotional designs to ballpoint pens. Confirm pen dimensions, positioning fixtures and the printable area with a sample test.</p></figcaption></figure></div><p class="dd-uv-sample-note">Application examples. Confirm ink adhesion, surface preparation and the required finish with a sample test on your actual material. Images do not define the standard machine configuration.</p><p><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}products/lz-6090uv-uv-flatbed-printer">Explore LZ-6090UV &amp; Request a Sample Test →</a></p></section><aside><h2>Plan Your Printing Setup</h2><p>Send your substrate, artwork, print size and production requirements. We provide free sample testing and help select the appropriate configuration.</p><a class="dd-printer-category__button" href="https://wa.me/8618988946615">Discuss Your Application</a><p><a href="mailto:info@gzcnc-laser.com">info@gzcnc-laser.com</a></p></aside></div></div>
